  "text": "Look, we want to help you win money at sports betting. All the people who actually make money doing this have models and ways to exploit the market, but they can't just announce exactly what they're doing because the sports books will catch on and then that edge will be gone. Now you can certainly pay for picks, but in a world full of fake touts who mislead you just to get your money, it's hard to know what to believe and who to trust. Our goal at Believe the Board is to give you the tools we've discovered the pros use to beat the books so that you can make the best possible bets and win more. We do this through our lives. We discuss predictive data and matchups, educational video series, and most importantly, our website. Here you can see matchup maps that are updated weekly to see how teams stack up against each other, both for NFL and college football. You can also see NFL QB comparisons, team breakdowns, and much more. Anyone can win a little at sports betting without looking at data, but it's impossible to win a lot at sports betting without diving deeply into it. This is why you hear us talk so much about things like predictive stats and quantifying edges. Now if you just want weekly or futures pick from our model, we got you. But if you want to make your own bets or your own model, we offer our complete databases as well. We do this because we're like you. We're three guys who just want to make a bunch of money watching our favorite sports on TV. We just quickly realized that the people who actually make a living off of sports betting do things way differently than some of these touts who make their living off of getting your money and leaving you with bad picks. Anyone who bets knows consistently winning is hard, and I'm not talking about coming out on top after 10, 20, or 50 bets. I'm talking about being profitable over hundreds to thousands of bets. So if this is up your alley, give us a follow and check out our website, bullytheboard.com. We'd 